From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pmos-laurel-sprout <dev@laurel.invalid>
Date: 2026-08-14
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: sm6125: laurel: enable MPSS remoteproc (v3)

Downstream-only v3 patch for the frozen 6.1 fork at
77de535b8dbd8f483b5802c8937cb714bab5b485.

Applies after 0001 (WCN3990 first-probe) and 0002 (MPSS transport v2,
remoteproc_mpss added with status = "disabled"). This board-level
enablement flips &remoteproc_mpss to "okay" so the MPSS boots on the
next physical test.

Kept separate from 0002 so the v2 disabled artifact stays bit-identical
and the 6.1 rollback path (boot_b + restore boot_a) is unchanged. The
first v3 artifact stops at MPSS bring-up gates (remoteproc running,
GLINK/IPCRTR, QRTR services, WLFW, FW_READY); wlan0/scan/association is
a later phase.

EXPERIMENTAL / BOOT-UNTESTED: enables the MPSS remoteproc; the bring-up
is not validated on hardware. Physical test requires explicit
authorization (FASE 8).

No MMC/SDIO, no iommus, no modem mem rework; memory-region stays
<&modem_mem> (0x4b000000).

Signed-off-by: pmos-laurel-sprout <dev@laurel.invalid>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel_sprout.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel_sprout.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel_sprout.dts
index 8c3f573..1b5eaf1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel_sprout.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel_sprout.dts
@@ -280,3 +280,7 @@
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+&remoteproc_mpss {
+	status = "okay";
+};
